ay=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Số trung bình của mẫu số liệu là\n\t\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>x</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>55</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>65</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>85</mn></mrow><mn>40</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>56</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Nhóm đầu tiên có tần số tích lũy lớn hơn hoặc bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>20</mn></semantics></math> là nhóm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó, trung vị của mẫu số liệu đã cho là\n\t\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>50</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>55</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Nhóm đầu tiên có tần số tích lũy lớn hơn hoặc bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>10</mn></semantics></math> là nhóm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>50</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó, tứ phân vị thứ nhất của mẫu số liệu đã cho là\n\t\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>40</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math><br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Nhóm đầu tiên có tần số tích lũy lớn hơn hoặc bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>30</mn></semantics></math> là nhóm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>70</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó, tứ phân vị thứ ba của mẫu số liệu đã cho là\n\t\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>28</mn></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>60</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>62</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math><br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>62</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
